WEBVTT

00:00:01.883 --> 00:00:05.990
Job Agent: help from Claude
Optional. Without it you still get templates.

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:09.582
Way 1: your own Anthropic API key
Enter it under Settings > AI and services

00:00:09.582 --> 00:00:13.020
Paste the key here
You create it at console.anthropic.com. Use is billed to your key.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.435
Optional: let Claude review new jobs
After each search, with a fit score if you include your profile

00:00:15.435 --> 00:00:18.025
Save
The key stays on this computer and is never shown again

00:00:18.025 --> 00:00:30.106
Then, on an accepted job: "Write with AI"
Claude writes the CV and letter from your own CV and profile

00:00:30.106 --> 00:00:33.000
It checks the draft and writes the files
The report says what was emphasized, and what was not claimed because your CV does not show it

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.864
Read it, correct it, send it yourself
A tailored draft built only from your own material

00:00:37.864 --> 00:00:44.527
It can also read your CV into your profile
My CV and profile: "Read with AI" next to an uploaded CV

00:00:44.527 --> 00:00:50.725
Way 2: no key needed
The same draft by copy and paste in a Claude chat

00:00:50.725 --> 00:00:53.933
"Copy for Claude" copies one message
The job, your profile, how the documents are written, and the rule: never invent anything

00:00:53.933 --> 00:00:59.737
Paste it into a Claude chat
Then copy Claude's whole answer

00:00:59.737 --> 00:01:11.441
Paste the answer back and press "Make the documents"
The same checks, the same files
